*.gguf
*.safetensors

# The compact, project-specific inference artifacts are small enough to make
# the public demo reproducible. The multi-gigabyte Gemma base/projector remain
# ignored and are documented in models/README.md.
!models/retinapriority-gemma4-26b/retinapriority-gemma4-26b-a4b-lora-f32.gguf
